114: }\r\n 115: \r\n 116: pub fn idx_path(csv_path: &Path) -> PathBuf {\r\n 117:     let mut p = csv_path.to_path_buf().into_os_string().into_string().unwrap();\r\n 118:     p.push_str(\".idx\");\r\n 119:     PathBuf::from(&p)\r\n 120: }\r\nFormat-Hex : The term 'Format-Hex' is not recognized as the name of a cmdlet, function, script file, or operable progra\r\nm. Check the spelling of the name, or if a path was included, verify that the path is correct and try again.\r\nAt line:2 char:174\r\n+ ... lt 120;$i++){ '{0,4}: {1}' -f ($i+1),$lines[$i] }; Format-Hex .\\probe ...\r\n+                                                        ~~~~~~~~~~\r\n    + CategoryInfo          : ObjectNotFound: (Format-Hex:String) [], CommandNotFoundException\r\n    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : CommandNotFoundException\r\n \r\n","metadata":{"exit_code":1,"duration_seconds":0.9}}
